What number does this print?

```javascript
const t = new EventTarget();
let count = 0;
t.addEventListener("ping", () => count++, { once: true });
t.addEventListener("ping", () => (count += 10));
t.dispatchEvent(new Event("ping"));
t.dispatchEvent(new Event("ping"));
console.log(count);
```

What does this print?

```javascript
const t = new EventTarget();
t.addEventListener("save", (e) => e.preventDefault());
console.log(t.dispatchEvent(new Event("save")), t.dispatchEvent(new Event("save", { cancelable: true })));
```

How many times does this print `hi`?

```javascript
const t = new EventTarget();
const same = () => console.log("hi");
t.addEventListener("x", same);
t.addEventListener("x", same);
t.addEventListener("x", () => console.log("hi"));
t.dispatchEvent(new Event("x"));
```
